# `jamasp translate` writes every sidecar through a same-directory temp file
# (jamasp/translatetext.py write_atomic). A kill mid-write leaves
# state/.stance.fa.md.XXXX.tmp behind, and the next agent run commits
# everything under CLAUDE.md rule 4 — including that.
.*.tmp
